    <system:String x:Key="Agreement_Body" xml:space="preserve">Vetale Browser SuperLite — User Agreement (v1.0.1, Sep 4, 2026). Contact: vetalebrowser01@gmail.com&#x0a;&#x0a;By selecting Accept &amp; Continue you confirm that you have read and agree to this Agreement.&#x0a;&#x0a;1. What this App is. A lightweight Windows browser (WPF + .NET, CefSharp/Chromium engine) with simple DuckDuckGo search and safety-first navigation.&#x0a;&#x0a;2. Online activity. Browsing requires network communication: opening a site connects your device to it; a search sends your query to DuckDuckGo. This is normal browser behavior.&#x0a;&#x0a;3. External services. The only built-in service is DuckDuckGo (https://duckduckgo.com) — their terms and privacy policy apply. Every website you open is a third-party service that may receive your IP, run scripts and store cookies.&#x0a;&#x0a;4. Navigation safety. A clear URL/domain opens directly, anything else becomes a DuckDuckGo search; only http/https are allowed, other schemes are blocked. This reduces accidents but does not guarantee protection.&#x0a;&#x0a;5. Popups. Popups/new windows are blocked; navigation stays in the main window.&#x0a;&#x0a;6. Local data. The App stores data locally on your PC: settings, history (if enabled), cookies/site data, and the agreement acceptance flag. No account is required.&#x0a;&#x0a;7. Security notice. Embedded browser components may have security considerations; full security cannot be guaranteed. You use the App at your own risk: avoid passwords/payments on untrusted sites, keep Windows and antivirus up to date, download only from trusted sources.&#x0a;&#x0a;8. Responsibilities. Use the App lawfully, not for illegal activities; online content may be unsafe.&#x0a;&#x0a;9. Disclaimer. THE APP IS PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTIES. The developer is not responsible for third-party sites, malware/phishing, or damages from use.&#x0a;&#x0a;10. Updates. The agreement may change in future versions; a significantly updated version may be shown again.&#x0a;&#x0a;11. Contact: vetalebrowser01@gmail.com</system:String>
